389
00:19:51,687 --> 00:19:54,126
Jadi, dia pasti mendapatkannya dari Liu Min.

390
00:19:54,566 --> 00:19:55,527
Anda mengatakan

391
00:19:55,527 --> 00:19:56,646
Dia menginterogasi Liu Min

392
